   * @param w the width of the rectangle
   * @param h the height of the rectangle
   * @see #getBounds()
   * @see #setLocation(int, int)
   * @see #setLocation(Point)
   * @see #setSize(int, int)
   * @see #setSize(Dimension)
   * @since 1.1
